# Repo-wide ignore rules for this multi-app AL repository (AL-Go for GitHub).
#
# Built .app files are no longer committed: CI/CD stamps versions and
# publishes builds as workflow artifacts / GitHub Releases.
# Third-party dependency apps needed only for compilation live in
# dependencies/ and ARE committed (see the exception below).

# --- Build output / packages ---
*.app
!dependencies/*.app
*.flf
*.bclicense
*.g.xlf
BuildOutput.txt
.output/
.dependencies/
.buildartifacts/
.packages/
cache_*

# --- AL symbol cache (re-downloadable via "AL: Download Symbols") ---
.alpackages/

# --- AL tooling local state ---
rad.json
.snapshots/
.alcache/
.altemplates/

# --- AL Test Runner: keep the checked-in config, drop local results ---
.altestrunner/*
!.altestrunner/config.json
TestResults*.xml
bcptTestResults*.json

# --- Windows / editor / Office noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.lnk
~$*
CLAUDE.md